        "amount": "70.00",
        "splitType": "EQUAL",
        "isPaid": false
      }
    ]
  }
}

docs {
  # Update Expense (`UpdateExpense`)
  
  **Handler**: `handlers.UpdateExpense` in [expense_handler.go](file:///d:/Codes/budget-tracker/go-server/handlers/expense_handler.go)
  **Route**: `PUT /api/_private/v1/expenses/:expenseId` (Private - Bearer Token required)
  
  ### Description
  Modifies an existing expense record atomically:
  - Updates top-level attributes (`amount`, `description`, `note`, `type`, `expenseDate`, `categoryId`, `groupId`).
  - Clears existing splits and recreates the updated split shares if `type = 'SPLIT'`.
  - Reloads related models with preloads (`Splits.User`, `Category`, `Group`).
  - Broadcasts `REFETCH_EXPENSES` event over WebSocket to all relevant members.
  
  ### Path Parameters
  - `expenseId` (string, path parameter): ID of the expense to update.
}
